Description: Leopard-style application dock for X11
 A dock with a 3D glass shelf and icon reflections along the bottom of the
 screen, or a 3D side panel on the left. Hover magnification, launch bounce,
 running-app lights, stacks (fan and grid), minimized-window tiles,
 drag to rearrange or remove with a poof, removable volumes and Trash.
 Under Compiz, windows minimize into the dock with the Magic Lamp effect.
